# Copy this file to .env (or .env.local) and fill in the real value.
# .env is gitignored — never commit the actual token.
#
# Must exactly match the "WRITE_TOKEN" Script Property set on the
# apps-script-planning project (Apps Script editor -> Project Settings ->
# Script Properties). Generate a random value, e.g.:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# See docs/Architecture/SPRINT_6_0_ARCHITECTURE.md, "Security," for why this
# exists, and its "Remaining risks" note in the Sprint 6.0 implementation
# report for what this mitigation does and does not guarantee.
VITE_PLANNING_WRITE_TOKEN=
